WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-02 - The Noise Outside
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.392
[Instrumental Intro — Warm Acoustic Guitar & Ambient Synth Pad]

00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:19.335
Hear that rumble bleeding through the door?

00:00:23.778 --> 00:00:26.721
Another heavy footstep on the floor

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:34.928
The press is waiting, cameras in the hall

00:00:38.251 --> 00:00:42.815
Waiting for the moment that we fall

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.653
Let them knock, let them wait out in the cold

00:00:52.296 --> 00:00:59.500
I'm so tired of doing what we're told

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:07.500
In this room, the walls are thick and deep

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.895
We can finally let the monsters sleep

00:01:16.028 --> 00:01:19.731
Close the blinds and lock the heavy gate

00:01:19.851 --> 00:01:24.035
Let the noise outside just dissipate

00:01:24.115 --> 00:01:28.599
When the world gets loud and demands a show

00:01:28.779 --> 00:01:32.322
We find a quiet place they'll never know

00:01:32.402 --> 00:01:37.006
Just the strum of the strings and the hum of the light

00:01:37.146 --> 00:01:39.608
Keeping the noise outside tonight

00:01:39.608 --> 00:01:59.495
[Instrumental Interlude — Acoustic Guitar & Ambient Synth]

00:01:59.495 --> 00:02:05.500
They want the friction, they want the blazing fire

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:13.500
They want to see us burning on the wire

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:21.500
But I can breathe when you are sitting near

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:27.151
You're the only truth I want to hear

00:02:30.814 --> 00:02:34.556
Close the blinds and lock the heavy gate

00:02:34.636 --> 00:02:38.739
Let the noise outside just dissipate

00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:43.322
When the world gets loud and demands a show

00:02:43.422 --> 00:02:46.944
We find a quiet place they'll never know

00:02:47.024 --> 00:02:51.608
Just the strum of the strings and the hum of the light

00:02:51.748 --> 00:02:55.000
Keeping the noise outside tonight

00:02:58.426 --> 00:03:06.000
Let the noise outside...

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:15.794
Just fade away.

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:33.000
[Outro — Soft Lingering Synth Chord]
